  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-better-deepseek",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness bridge plugin for [Better DeepSeek](https://github.com/EdgeTypE/better-deepseek) Chrome extension integration. Provides an HTTP handshake endpoint and session-filtered SSE event streams over `webServer`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Via DSH (npm)",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add -w dsh-better-deepseek\n```\n\nor\n\n```bash\nnpx @deepseek-ai/dsh --profile web add -w dsh-better-deepseek\n```\n\n<!-- ### Via PowerShell One-Liner (Windows)\n```powershell\nirm https://raw.githubusercontent.com/EdgeTypE/dsh-better-deepseek/main/scripts/install.ps1 | iex\n``` -->"
    },
    {
      "section": "Plugin",
      "text": "`BetterDeepSeekBridgeService` registers `/api/better-deepseek/*` endpoints on `ctx.webServer`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Plugin",
      "text": "| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n|---|---|---|\n| `/api/better-deepseek/ping` | GET | Handshake and health check |\n| `/api/better-deepseek/events` | GET | Server-Sent Events (SSE) live stream |\n| `/api/better-deepseek/session.create` | POST | Initialize an agent session with cwd |\n| `/api/better-deepseek/session.prompt` | POST | Submit a task/prompt to the session |\n| `/api/better-deepseek/session.result` | GET | Fetch final Markdown report and status |\n| `/api/better-deepseek/session.cancel` | POST | Cancel a running task |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Plugin",
      "text": "| Config | Default | Meaning |\n|---|---|---|\n| `enableCors` | `true` | Enables Access-Control-Allow-Origin headers for cross-origin browser extension requests. |"
    }
  ],
